<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "read one exact local offering by its CID"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.offering.inspects", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.offering.inspects"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.offering.inspects"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.offering.inspects ~ one immutable gift, read

`lares nexus offering inspect <offering-cid>` reads one exact local gift through the store door: its inspection status, byte status and adoption.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ inspect

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`inspect` params=`act/inspect cid/<offering-cid> ~ read one offering`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ act · cid

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`act` params=`takes/word needs/required seat/1 as/<inspect> ~ inspect`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`cid` params=`takes/cid needs/required seat/2 as/<offering-cid> ~ the offering`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat-or-hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat-or-hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads the local store`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · not-found · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.offering.inspects act/inspect cid/<offering-cid>]] ~ name inspect and one CID`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`not-found` params=`~ no offering of that CID stands here`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ inspected

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`inspected` params=`exit/0 ~ the inspection`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus offering

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares nexus offering]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

